          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Without the firm hand of a patron, your power begins to reflect deeper complexities, sometimes latching onto entirely unexpected sources of magical potency. When you cast or Sustain @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Manifest Will], you can choose any tradition's manifestation. While the spell is active, you and allies in its area gain a +1 status bonus to saves against spells with that tradition trait.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 6
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
