    {
      "fileName": "patron-reborn.json",
      "id": "5jsMIFF9uYekQZpU",
      "name": "Patron Reborn",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "5jsMIFF9uYekQZpU",
        "folder": "IeZQtve7rif8lAKY",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Patron Reborn",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You have fully realized the ability to serve as a patron.</p>\n<p>Your newfound abilities enhance your senses, rolling back the veil of a realm hidden to most mortals where great beings vie for unimaginable influence over vast worlds. You gain darkvision, constant @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Truesight], and the ability to see into all other transitive planes that overlap the one you are in.</p>\n<p>You can be a patron for other witches. Choose a single type of patron you represent, such as @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.The Resentment] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Starless Shadow]. An allied witch you can observe who has that patron counts as and gains the benefits of your @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Witch's Charge] feat, even if you did not select them as your charge during your daily preparations.</p>\n<p>You learn the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wish] ritual and can impart that knowledge to your charges. Once per month, when one of your charges performs the <em>wish</em> ritual, you can roll the skill check in their place.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 20
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Seneschal Witch Dedication"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder War of Immortals"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "subfeatures": {
            "senses": {
              "darkvision": {},
              "truesight": {
                "acuity": "imprecise",
                "range": 60
              }
            }
          },
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "archetype"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 20,
      "category": "class"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "patrons-glamour.json",
      "id": "ejGRaQTZYWFSFIW0",
      "name": "Patron's Glamour",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "ejGRaQTZYWFSFIW0",
        "folder": "IeZQtve7rif8lAKY",
