          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You gain the ability to speak to your charge over great distances. You gain @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Message] as an innate cantrip of your former patron's tradition. You can send a <em>message</em> to a creature regardless of range if they have ever been your charge. If you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Lie] as part of the message, the target receives a –2 circumstance penalty to their Perception DC and to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Sense Motive] checks to reveal the lie.</p>"
          },
